<!-- GNUbase's fonts (#207) in 360x250 dp: the user interface's family at the themes' font sizes and in every weight,
     the counter family, characters from the fallback font, other alphabets, and pseudo-localized text, which the test
     fills in. Its screenshots are tests/golden/ui/fonts-1x.png and fonts-2x.png. -->
<rml>
<head>
	<title>Fonts</title>
	<style>
		body {
			display: block; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 360dp; height: 250dp; margin: 0;
			padding: 10dp; box-sizing: border-box; background-color: #1d2127; color: #e8eaed;
			font-family: Inter; font-size: 13dp;
		}
		p { display: block; margin: 0 0 4dp 0; white-space: nowrap; }
		.display { font-size: 20dp; font-weight: 600; }
		.title { font-size: 15dp; font-weight: 600; }
		.label { font-size: 12dp; }
		.small { font-size: 11dp; color: #9aa3ad; }
		.counter { font-family: JetBrains Mono; font-size: 15dp; }
		.medium { font-weight: 500; }
		.semibold { font-weight: 600; }
		.bold { font-weight: bold; }
		.italic { font-style: italic; }
	</style>
</head>
<body>
	<p class="display">GNUbase 0123456789</p>
	<p class="title">Audio Connections</p>
	<p>The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog.</p>
	<p class="label">Sample rate 48.000 kHz · Bars → Seconds</p>
	<p class="small">Volume −6.0 dB · −∞ dB · ½ × 25%</p>
	<p>Regular · <span class="medium">Medium</span> · <span class="semibold">SemiBold</span> ·
		<span class="bold">Bold</span> · <span class="italic">Italic</span></p>
	<p class="counter">0001.01.01.000 <span class="bold">00:01:23.456</span></p>
	<p>Key: C♯ major · B♭ minor · F♮</p>
	<p>Größe · Ελληνικά · Кириллица · Tiếng Việt</p>
	<p id="pseudo"/>
</body>
</rml>
